            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HOLLY D"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My Mom made Potato soup this way, and I have myself for years. Sometimes I jazz it up a bit and add cheese, bacon, celery, or sometimes I am in the mood for plain Old Fashioned Potato soup. The only things I do different from this recipe is use cmilk and 2% milk, and I also add a stick of butter or Margarine. Easy to make and tastes yummy."
          },
