              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy Conwell Spade"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy, Easy, Easy! Wonderful base to start a great potato soup! Add whatever you want to jazz it up. I made this recipe for 50 people. Lots of compliments!!",
